==Latin==

===Alternative forms===
* [[nec-]]

===Etymology===
The word {{m|la|nē}} in compositions.

===Prefix===
{{head|la|prefix}}

# [[absolutely]] [[negate]]s the principal meaning
#: {{m|la|ne-|'''ne-'''|not}} + {{m|la|scio||I know}} → {{m|la|nescio|'''ne'''scio|I '''don't''' know}}

====Quotations====
"[[Nomen]] [[nescio]]." ([[N.N.]]) - I don't know the name, [[John Doe]]

