==Latvian==

===Etymology===
From the same stem as the general negative particle {{m|lv|nē||no}}.

===Prefix===
{{lv-prefix}}

# Used on all verb forms to form the negative version of that form ({{m|lv|runāju||I speak}}, {{m|lv|nerunāju||I don't speak}}), as well as on nouns and adjectives to indicate negation (like {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|en|in-}}, {{m|en|im-}}; {{cog|en|un-}}; or {{cog|ru|не-}}).

====Derived terms====
{{prefixsee|lv}}

